CELL|Silent synapses and AMPAR trafficking|Silent synapses unsilenced during learning|Not searched; background knowledge|C|-|M|-|Animal. Included for completeness.
CELL|Heterosynaptic plasticity and synaptic competition|Changes at inactive synapses balance changes at active ones|Not searched; background knowledge|C|-|M|-|Animal. Normalisation-like local mechanism.
